{"t":"Alawar's Vault Quest","s":"alawar-s-vault-quest-11f61","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/Alawars_Vault_Lever_25f638.gif","q":3,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Alawar's Vault Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Senja Minotaur Quest, Senja Castle Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(25 recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.5<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 19, 2001</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>Alawar has hidden his treasure, which is guarded by his fierce minotaurs and dangerous magical fields.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Senja\">Senja</a>/<a href=\"#/wiki/Folda\">Folda</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Troll\">Frost Trolls</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Spider\">Spiders</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Bug\">Bugs</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Slime\">Slimes</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Scorpion\">Scorpions</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur\">Minotaurs</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Archer\">Minotaur Archers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Guard\">Minotaur Guards</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Mage\">Minotaur Mages</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Bonelord\">Bonelords</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p>3 <a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Pearl\">White Pearls</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Broadsword\">Broadsword</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Helmet\">Dark Helmet</a>, 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Throwing%20Knife\">Throwing Knives</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Blank%20Rune\">Blank Rune</a>, 33gp, <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%204501\">Key 4501</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%204502\">Key 4502</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%204503\">Key 4503</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<div class=\"messagebox\" style=\";\"><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Please review this page.</p><br/><p>This page may need to be updated for content, grammar, spelling, language, etc.</p><p style=\"font-style:italic;font-size:x-small;\">Please remove this template after the page has been raised to appropriate standards of quality.</p></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Equipment\">Equipment</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Travel money (at least 20gp)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Pick\">Pick</a> or equivalent</li>\n<li>One <a href=\"#/wiki/Destroy%20Field%20Rune\">Destroy Field Rune</a> if you take the short path</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%204503\">Key 4503</a> (if already received, long path only)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%204502\">Key 4502</a> (if already received, or for short path (only for full rewards))</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Foreword\">Foreword</span></h2>\n<p>This quest has two parts: the long path is though <a href=\"#/wiki/Folda\">Folda</a> and the short path is through <a href=\"#/wiki/Senja\">Senja</a>.\n</p><p>The short path will grant you the minor rewards: 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Pearl\">White Pearls</a> and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Broadsword\">Broadsword</a>. If you have <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%204502\">Key 4502</a> in advance, you can also receive: <a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Helmet\">Dark Helmet</a>, 4 <a href=\"#/wiki/Throwing%20Knife\">Throwing Knives</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Blank%20Rune\">Blank Rune</a>, 33gp and <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%204502\">Key 4502</a>.\n</p><p>The long path grants you all rewards, including the key <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%204503\">4503</a>. This does not require <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%204502\">Key 4502</a> but if you have already received it, you should bring it (or you may be trapped).\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h2>\n<h3><span id=\"w-Short_Path_.28Senja.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Short_Path_(Senja)\">Short Path (Senja)</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Go to <a href=\"#/wiki/Senja\">Senja</a> via the raft north of <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a> (20gp, ferry <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32234,31677,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32234, 31677, 7)</a>).</li>\n<li>Enter the <a href=\"#/wiki/Senja%20Castle\">Senja Castle</a> cellar (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32191,31633,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32191, 31633, 7)</a>).</li>\n<li>Cross the fields to the far west and find a lever beneath <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire\">fire</a>. Use a <a href=\"#/wiki/Destroy%20Field\">Destroy Field</a> rune to reveal a <a href=\"#/wiki/Lever\">lever</a>.</li>\n<li>Pull the lever and it will vanish, the magic walls to the north will also have disappeared.</li>\n<li>Enter the <a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Forcefield\">Magic Forcefield</a> to enter <a href=\"#/quest/alawars-vault-quest\">Alawar's Vault</a>. Beware <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur\">Minotaurs</a> and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur%20Mage\">Minotaur Mage</a> - unless the door is locked they will be able to reach you.</li>\n<li>Open the 2 chests by the teleporter to receive your reward.</li>\n<li>Go back through the teleporter to appear on the top of the castle. Alternatively if you brought <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%204502\">key 4502</a>, follow the long path (below) backwards for the rest of the rewards.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Alawars Vault Lever\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"384\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Alawars_Vault_Lever_25f638.gif\" width=\"608\"/></span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"91a968b8aa42a52497934b55d00e9549\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Alawars_Vault_Portal-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"Portal to Alawar's Vault\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Portal to Alawar's Vault\" height=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Alawars_Vault_Portal_52658d.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Alawars Vault Portal.png (129 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Portal to Alawar's Vault</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Alawars_Vault_Reward_Room-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:111px; width:185px; top:37px;\"><img alt=\"Alawar's Vault. Search the chests near the portal for your reward.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Alawar's Vault. Search the chests near the portal for your reward.\" height=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Alawars_Vault_Reward_Room_6c3c8b.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Alawars Vault Reward Room.png (312 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Alawar's Vault. Search the chests near the portal for your reward.</div></div></div>\n<h3><span id=\"w-Long_Path_.28Folda.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Long_Path_(Folda)\">Long Path (Folda)</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Go to <a href=\"#/wiki/Folda\">Folda</a> via the ferry north of <a href=\"#/wiki/Carlin\">Carlin</a> (20gp).</li>\n<li>Enter <a href=\"#/wiki/Folda\">Folda</a> caves (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"31999,31571,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (31999, 31571, 7)</a>).</li></ul>\n<div class=\"spoiler image container\" style=\"width:500px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;background:#d5d5d5;border:2px solid #bdbdbd;clear:both;\">\n<div class=\"spoiler image img\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Alawars Vault Route\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"395\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Alawars_Vault_Route_eb585f.png\" width=\"500\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"spoiler image desc\" style=\"text-align:center;padding:0.3em 0 0.1em;border-top:1px solid #aeaeae;\">\n<p>There are many routes, but this is the quickest:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Follow the dark green lines to find a chest with <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%204503\">Key 4503</a>.</li>\n<li>Backtrack to the light green line, follow it and use <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%204503\">Key 4503</a> to the <i>protected area</i>.</li>\n<li>Use <a href=\"#/wiki/Pick\">Pick</a> on the fire at the end of the line.</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Follow the map above, or:\n<ul><li>From the start of the cave, follow south-west until you come to a room with <a href=\"#/wiki/Minotaur\">Minotaurs</a>. Where south-west is not an option, follow south-east.</li>\n<li>To the west, get <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%204503\">Key 4503</a> from a chest in the western room.</li>\n<li>Backtrack and find the <i>protected area</i>. Enter with <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%204503\">Key 4503</a> and follow to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire\">fire</a> fields.</li>\n<li>Use pick on the fire field against the wall, between stone piles</li>\n<li>Go down the hole. <b>Note:</b> you cannot return here! You'll fall two levels down, with the second level being 1 sqm with only a hole. The only way to return is to complete the quest.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"1\" hash=\"c1202fe22223f3684fa04ba6c0613557\" id=\"w-gallery-1\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:126px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Alawars_Vault_Hole-gif\" style=\"position: relative; height:124px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"The entrance to Alawar's Cave.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"The entrance to Alawar's Cave.\" height=\"124\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Alawars_Vault_Hole_1b3f89.gif\" style=\"\" title=\"Alawars Vault Hole.gif (95 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">The entrance to Alawar's Cave.</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"spoiler image container\" style=\"width:550px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;background:#d5d5d5;border:2px solid #bdbdbd;clear:both;\">\n<div class=\"spoiler image img\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Alawar's Quest Route\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"465\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Alawar_s_Quest_Route_b0bb8b.png\" width=\"550\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"spoiler image desc\" style=\"text-align:center;padding:0.3em 0 0.1em;border-top:1px solid #aeaeae;\">\n<p>Follow the green line to get <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%204501\">Key 4501</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Key%204502\">Key 4502</a> and then follow it to <a href=\"#/quest/alawars-vault-quest\">Alawar's Vault</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"2\" hash=\"28fb43f964ad9e1795c547063c43b395\" id=\"w-gallery-2\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:166px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Alawars_Vault_Key_4501-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:164px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"Key 4501.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\".\" height=\"164\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Alawars_Vault_Key_4501_6b961a.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Alawars Vault Key 4501.png (122 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%204501\">Key 4501</a>.</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:166px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Alawars_Vault_Key_4502-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:164px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"Key 4502.\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\".\" height=\"164\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Alawars_Vault_Key_4502_3fa8dc.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Alawars Vault Key 4502.png (143 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Key%204502\">Key 4502</a>.</div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":["alawars-vault-quest","measuring-tibia-quest","the-ice-islands-quest"]}